## Naming convention

Per the polyrepo steering (`structure.md`), agents follow
`{domain}-{function}` — e.g. `network-recon`, `prompt-injector`. The
DNS-label regex `^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9]$` is enforced by
`gibson component init`.
